      "en": "“Son of man, wail for the multitude of Egypt, and cast them down, even her and the daughters of the famous nations, to the lower parts of the earth, with those who go down into the pit.",
      "ko": "인자야 애굽의 무리를 애곡하고 그와 유명한 나라 여자들을 구덩이에 내려가는 자와 함께 지하에 던지며",
      "source_text_hash": "9035287f59c7225d76a5aaad63521c6310a78d52085267f490a8a547aad42c5c",
      "translation_text_hash": "3eb49fde7adad0faa5c603aee12ba3f892e0fe545a71623ab245d224032011d2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
