      "en": "They will fall among those who are slain by the sword. She is delivered to the sword. Draw her away with all her multitudes.",
      "ko": "그들이 살륙 당한 자 중에 엎드러질 것임이여 그는 칼에 붙인바 되었은즉 그와 그 모든 무리를 끌찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "b073d960f62db996d928b10b23ca1154081a8647d753d7dd7b6ef1d2fd302869",
